      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# LTX 2.5 Director (complete workflow)\n\nClean-room MIT.\n\n## Wiring\n\n1. Load LTX 2.5 UNET, Gemma4-with-proj CLIP, Video VAE, and Audio VAE.\n2. Shot images: drop onto a shot in the Director panel, or Load Image -> `LTXVPreprocess` -> Director (left IMAGE sockets are hidden; wires still attach).\n3. Connect Video VAE to Director **vae** so GUIDE is applied on this node.\n4. Stage 1 sample -> Separate -> **Crop guides** (bake/remove keyframes) -> Latent Upscale 2x -> Stage 2 DualCFG (cropped cond, no keyframe tokens) -> Decode.\n5. Do **not** skip Crop before upscale: Stage 2 will crash if GUIDE tokens still match the old spatial size.\n6. Bypass the **Stage 2 \u2014 Latent Upscale** group if you OOM (8GB).\n\n## Director sockets (optional)\n\n- **Video VAE (GUIDE)** \u2014 required for stills / motion GUIDE\n- Shot / IC-LoRA IMAGE+VIDEO sockets stay in the API but are hidden; drop files or wires on the panel\n- **IC-LoRA downscale** \u2014 float from `LTXICLoRALoaderModelOnly` (the LoRA itself goes on **model**)\n- **I2V / custom latent** \u2014 replace empty video latent; this is not the 2x upscale stage\n\n## Weights (models/)\n\n- `diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors` (CLIP type = **ltxv**)\n- `vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors`\n- `vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors`\n- `latent_upscale_models/ltx-2.3-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.1.safetensors`\n"
      ],
      "title": "LTX 2.5 Director",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000",
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# LTX 2.5 Director (complete workflow)\n\nClean-room MIT.\n\n## Wiring\n\n1. Load LTX 2.5 UNET, Gemma4-with-proj CLIP, Video VAE, and Audio VAE.\n2. Shot images: drop onto a shot in the Director panel, or Load Image -> `LTXVPreprocess` -> Director (left IMAGE sockets are hidden; wires still attach).\n3. Connect Video VAE to Director **vae** so GUIDE is applied on this node.\n4. Stage 1 sample -> Separate -> **Crop guides** (bake/remove keyframes) -> Latent Upscale 2x -> Stage 2 DualCFG (cropped cond, no keyframe tokens) -> Decode.\n5. Do **not** skip Crop before upscale: Stage 2 will crash if GUIDE tokens still match the old spatial size.\n6. Bypass the **Stage 2 \u2014 Latent Upscale** group if you OOM (8GB).\n\n## Director sockets (optional)\n\n- **Video VAE (GUIDE)** \u2014 required for stills / motion GUIDE\n- Shot / IC-LoRA IMAGE+VIDEO sockets stay in the API but are hidden; drop files or wires on the panel\n- **IC-LoRA downscale** \u2014 float from `LTXICLoRALoaderModelOnly` (the LoRA itself goes on **model**)\n- **I2V / custom latent** \u2014 replace empty video latent; this is not the 2x upscale stage\n\n## Weights (models/)\n\n- `diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors` (CLIP type = **ltxv**)\n- `vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors`\n- `vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors`\n- `latent_upscale_models/ltx-2.3-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.1.safetensors`\n"
      }
    },
